# ============================================================
# WIZARD'S TOWER - WORLDEDIT COMMAND SCRIPT
# Footprint: 13 x 13 (X: -6 to 6, Z: -6 to 6)
# Height: Y=63 (foundation) to Y=96 (spire)
# Ground level: Y=64
#
# 5 Floors:
#   1. Entry Hall      (Y=64) - bookshelves, rune rug, storage
#   2. Alchemy Lab     (Y=69) - brewing stands, cauldrons, barrels
#   3. Library         (Y=74) - bookshelf ring, lectern, reading nook
#   4. Enchanting Room (Y=79) - enchanting table + bookshelf array
#   5. Study/Bedroom   (Y=84) - bed, desk, ender chest
#   Roof               (Y=89+) - stepped spire with amethyst cluster
#
# Materials:
#   - deepslate_bricks / cracked_deepslate_bricks / amethyst_block (walls)
#   - dark_oak_planks (floors)
#   - purple_stained_glass (windows)
#   - bookshelf, lectern, enchanting_table, brewing_stand, cauldron,
#     crafting_table, chest, ender_chest, purple_bed, candle, lantern
# ============================================================


